            "dynamicDescription": "希瓦娜每秒對鄰近敵軍造成<magicDamage>@Damage@魔法傷害</magicDamage>，<speed>跑速提升@BaseMoveSpeed*100@%</speed>，持續@MoveSpeedDuration@秒。希瓦娜的<speed>跑速</speed>加成會逐漸降低。普攻會使<spellName>聖龍怒火</spellName>的持續時間延長@DurationIncreasePerHit@秒，至多延長@MaxDurationIncrease@秒。<br><br><keywordMajor>聖龍形態：</keywordMajor><spellName>聖龍怒火</spellName>將地面化為焦土，持續對身處其中的敵軍造成傷害。@SpellModifierDescriptionAppend@",
